  "body": "Fixes #1238. Usually, the popped stack entry is not the element, but\ninstead an already-constructed marker. This makes the stack-popping\ngeneric, and also adds a note explaining exactly what could be going on\nhere.\n\n@dominiccooney to review. FYI @rniwa since you came up with this algorithm and I messed it up when putting it into the spec.\n",
